      "statement": "migrateBlocks is one pure chain for stored-content migration and render-time upgrades: it maps blocks in order, passes unknown _type through untouched, validates _version is an integer between 1 and the type currentVersion, and advances one migrations-map step at a time to currentVersion without mutating its input.",
