      "statement": "migrateBlocks throws one of three error classes naming the block and version: Unsupported version (non-integer, below 1 or above currentVersion), Missing migration (the map lacks the step for the stored version), and Invalid migration (a step does not preserve _key and _type and advance _version by exactly one).",
